# A design's own picture (docs/sdk/packages-and-data.md "A design's own picture"): with the
# fixture mod tests/fixtures/mods/picture-pack, whose ship picture "Lancer" is a PNG at twice
# the classic size, the ship designer's picture has a small arrow in its corner. Its list
# offers the hull's picture and the mod's; the chosen one shows in the designer, and the
# design made (a copy of a starting design, so that it is complete) keeps it in Designs and
# when it is edited; Save for SE IV refuses the game while a design shows a picture the
# installed game lacks (docs/BUILDING.md "Input scripts").
# layouts: both (also plays at 800x600: run_input_tests.py --small)
options --quick-start=Terran --seed=7 --open=designs --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800 --mod=tests/fixtures/mods/picture-pack

wait-window designs
# A new design has no hull yet: no picture to choose.
click tag:designs:create
click item:Ship in=designs
wait-window create-design
assert-absent item:##pictures in=create-design
key Escape
wait-closed create-design
# A copy of the first ship design: its hull's picture, and the choice.
click item:##row in=designs nth=1
assert-present item:design-picture:hull in=designs
click item:Copy in=designs
wait-window create-design
assert-present item:design-picture:hull in=create-design
click item:##pictures in=create-design
wait-for item:picture:Lancer
assert-present item:picture:hull
screenshot designer-picture-choice.png
click item:picture:Lancer
wait 2
assert-present item:design-picture:Lancer in=create-design
assert-fits create-design
screenshot designer-picture.png
click tag:create-design:name
type "Lancer Prime"
wait 2
click tag:create-design:save
wait-closed create-design
assert { command = "CreateDesign" }
# In Designs, with its picture.
click item:"Lancer Prime" in=designs
assert-present item:design-picture:Lancer in=designs
screenshot designs-picture.png
# Save for SE IV refuses the game: the original cannot show a picture only the mod has.
key Escape
wait-closed designs
key F2
wait-window game-menu
click item:"Save Game" in=game-menu
wait-window save-game
click item:"Save for SE IV" in=save-game
wait-for item:Close in="Save for Space Empires IV"
click item:Save in="Save for Space Empires IV"
wait-for item:result:failed in="Save for Space Empires IV"
screenshot save-for-se4-refused.png
click item:Close in="Save for Space Empires IV"
wait-gone item:Close in="Save for Space Empires IV"
key Escape
wait-closed save-game
click tag:command:designs
wait-window designs
click item:"Lancer Prime" in=designs
# Edited (a prototype), it keeps the picture; back to the hull's.
click item:Edit in=designs
wait-window create-design
assert-present item:design-picture:Lancer in=create-design
click item:##pictures in=create-design
wait-for item:picture:hull
click item:picture:hull
wait 2
assert-present item:design-picture:hull in=create-design
click tag:create-design:save
wait-closed create-design
click item:"Lancer Prime" in=designs
assert-present item:design-picture:hull in=designs
key Escape
wait-closed designs
